{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "071a6e1b92e03601d90f5eae4087bb0e4ecb9c6dc0a45b8197f0c6296f7be74e", "ja": "キラキラな明日", "zh": "闪亮亮的明天", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "06bff1c443f81e4c8fb57c0beb915424a191015bf59ac669fb7412be80d4402f", "ja": "流れ星を探しに夜のキャンプ場へ来たやよい\n達は、満天の星空の下、ようやく見つけた\n流れ星に大はしゃぎ。リリースイベントが\n終わったら、再びみんなでキャンプ場へ遊び\nに来ることを約束する。", "zh": "弥生等人为了寻找流星，在夜里来到露营场。\n在满天星斗下，她们终于找到流星，而兴奋不\n已。并约定好在发片活动结束后，大家再一起\n到露营场玩耍。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_05_1000_null", "source_sha256": "e51b5c5c34a3d8d8186ec918a07354c47ffdc43fda8306b95d6fecc893d03bc5", "ja": "山中のキャンプ場……", "zh": "山里的露营场……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_05_1001_p", "source_sha256": "f9fa48820b7abab525f48cf08a18ad130bfb0c5654005577c332e0d67c442e27", "ja": "（4人を連れて、この辺りで一番星が見えるという\nスポットまでやってきた）", "zh": "（我带着她们四个人，\n来到了这附近最佳的观星地点。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_05_1002_p", "source_sha256": "281e7506e0684ad94d0e4e042b00cf3297afc7d3616de184b42a1460bc4f9e7a", "ja": "（それほど長くはいられないが……。\n果たして、流星は見られるだろうか）", "zh": "（虽然不能停留太久……\n到底能不能看到流星呢？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_05_1003_040tam", "source_sha256": "b378924ef5be96a057e321efdff36bae0aae685143c92213d9d789fa6caea920", "ja": "うわぁ～！　見て見て、おやぶん！\n空に星がいっぱいだぞ～！", "zh": "哇～！老大，你看你看！\n天上有好多星星喔～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_05_1004_030iku", "source_sha256": "c7db77e7df7ec8c0d73170cfa6d6e0f03b33b09e8868a4459008a60316ae7914", "ja": "本当だ……すごくキレイ～！\n晴れてよかった～♪", "zh": "真的耶……好漂亮～！\n幸好今天是晴天～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_05_1005_005yay", "source_sha256": "765856959e0a22630fc9a877b9b63cf5ea9aca3c3c1042af93b1f740d9fc6f68", "ja": "うっうー！\nこれならすぐに流れ星が見つかりそうだね！", "zh": "呜呜──！\n这么一来应该很快就能看到流星了吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_05_1006_005yay", "source_sha256": "fcc769da173c1461d239db013c4b27adfcbe0684806025da9e95dd90c61059bf", "ja": "よーし、みんなで協力して、流れ星を探そー！", "zh": "好──！大家同心协力，一起找流星吧──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_05_1007_036kan", "source_sha256": "c34eaadd1f3fc761c401ca4884ef6a64d06009efad2944523969dc86917ab78d", "ja": "お～！", "zh": "好～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_05_1008_030iku", "source_sha256": "c34eaadd1f3fc761c401ca4884ef6a64d06009efad2944523969dc86917ab78d", "ja": "お～！", "zh": "好～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_05_1009_040tam", "source_sha256": "c34eaadd1f3fc761c401ca4884ef6a64d06009efad2944523969dc86917ab78d", "ja": "お～！", "zh": "好～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_05_1010_null", "source_sha256": "f57cfdaa3423982ac99cb2c739d50536ade8181714dd218d7b7e16d5029bb1e3", "ja": "10分後……", "zh": "10分钟后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_05_1011_036kan", "source_sha256": "e6c284410a01cd75144ad778d057a3177f2f696dae89112dea50bd48c1584846", "ja": "あっ！　あれ違う？\nあっち、高い木の上の方が光ってるよ！", "zh": "啊！那个是吗？\n那边，高高的树上面有东西在亮！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_05_1012_040tam", "source_sha256": "d6e1c1cbcc7218570bd053b1e454a52390aa782b3af1f4bb69e9a5ca259aa3f6", "ja": "どこどこ！？\nたまきも見たいぞ～！", "zh": "哪里哪里！？\n环也想看～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_05_1013_p", "source_sha256": "9347c65135f155224a621b80d7b06152e771c7b84bc45642f486e7e9a438f14c", "ja": "いや、あれは……飛行機の点滅じゃないかな。", "zh": "不，那应该是……飞机的灯在闪烁吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_05_1014_036kan", "source_sha256": "d84dae1a9d0b7d54fb078c0072aa34da389466c4f460e31946e3483ab27226cd", "ja": "あ、本当だ、ゴォーって音も聞こえる……。\nうう、間違えちゃいました～。", "zh": "啊，真的耶，还能听到轰～的声音……\n呜呜，我搞错了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_05_1015_036kan", "source_sha256": "414cfd169ffc4000fdf41df95f786c9f7216d2a01b45038878cc6fecee941bbe", "ja": "でも、次は絶対見つけますっ！\nピカピカ流れ星～♪　見つけてハッピー可奈矢吹～♪", "zh": "但我下次一定要找对！\n闪亮亮的流星～♪找到之后HAPPY可奈矢吹～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_05_1016_030iku", "source_sha256": "7fc466e8c0effdbca26173ec14f4c6e9d640a361c3a17df25ebf2ea2fc614537", "ja": "あ！　あれは！？\nあの山の右側にあるやつ！", "zh": "啊！那个呢！？\n那座山右边的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_05_1017_p", "source_sha256": "374d1c861fedce042ca99603506c1f823419de1d9759d3460e8db87ae2eef548", "ja": "あれは……普通の星、かな。流れ星は一瞬で\n消えちゃうから、あんなふうにずっとは残ってないよ。", "zh": "那应该……是普通的星星吧。流星一瞬间就会\n消失了，不会像那样停在空中喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_05_1018_030iku", "source_sha256": "df1805338872c75087c5d591e90ddab607870313c7adfa9739ffbd74d90fb89a", "ja": "そっか……残念。", "zh": "这样啊……真可惜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_05_1019_005yay", "source_sha256": "cde9f7e5b2f1cd8d97ab8db727aeb6267ceec24c23e0819a0a4c6679bd9715ce", "ja": "育ちゃん、大丈夫だよ！\n次は絶対に見つかるからね！", "zh": "小育，没问题的！\n下次绝对可以找到！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_05_1020_030iku", "source_sha256": "3e0b1076a3d79aed29ab23adb2f9a3b224741c37fb9c424b64575857d3966b61", "ja": "やよいさん……。うんっ！\nわたし、がんばって探すね！", "zh": "弥生姊姊……嗯！\n我会努力认真找！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_05_1021_040tam", "source_sha256": "353ffdc813ccbd1eaf6517158bb938a0f322756b8dbe23e1e2fc4b9b1c918b15", "ja": "うぅ、上ばっかり見てたら、\nたまき、なんか首がいたくなってきちゃった……。", "zh": "呜呜，一直看着天空，\n环的脖子开始痛了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_05_1022_036kan", "source_sha256": "6262e4c979082fabe58182e7b0056601ac7af723aae098075266dc4b833851da", "ja": "環ちゃん、環ちゃん！\nいざとなったら寝ころんじゃえばいいんだよっ。ほら！", "zh": "小环，小环！\n受不了时候躺下来就好了喔，你看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_05_1023_040tam", "source_sha256": "4c75fce57ea032f4aaf09a292b3df22cdb99928d8592f5905517c58a6150c727", "ja": "あ、そっかぁ！　かな、頭いいね♪\nたまきもたまきも～！", "zh": "啊，原来如此！可奈好聪明喔♪\n环也要、环也要～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_05_1024_null", "source_sha256": "77f682c7e947dc9078fa4b8ba512fe92d2c5fba430f3fe2adc68ca93a9c144fd", "ja": "20分後……", "zh": "20分钟后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_05_1025_p", "source_sha256": "5c21fd4092b805045cf990a8c545ea253599f11170f59287957fd52ea7529414", "ja": "うーん、なかなか見つからないな。\nあまり遅くなるわけにはいかないが……。", "zh": "唔～都找不太到耶。\n可是也不能留到太晚……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_05_1026_005yay", "source_sha256": "1751aaa2363891727f9204a8ad3df0b90259151f04c753fc157b1c20015e4128", "ja": "あの……もう少しだけ、ダメですかー？\n流れ星、みんなで……一緒に見たいですー。", "zh": "那个……不能再待一下下吗──？\n我想和大家一起……看流星……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_05_1027_p", "source_sha256": "2dcfcfbd31b08c55f25747d2f8116b4cf82de7a635f620dc69abdf40f9680cc7", "ja": "そうだな……わかった、できる限り粘ろう。\nでも、ご家族が心配するから、無茶はできないぞ。", "zh": "这个嘛……我知道了，尽可能坚持下去吧。\n但是你们的家人会担心，不能乱来喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_05_1028_036kan", "source_sha256": "bee3199d67fbd12beda6e64fdde4bb44751d147f97bac286d82161adac74cf2b", "ja": "流れ星～、流れ星～、今すぐ欲し～……\nあっ、見えた～っ！", "zh": "流星～流星～我现在就想看……\n啊，看到了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_05_1029_040tam", "source_sha256": "d05ea3ab75b57e2c281d06d92446b81c25d09834744724656f4d454eb229f1fe", "ja": "えっ、どこどこ！？", "zh": "咦，哪里哪里！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_05_1030_036kan", "source_sha256": "3903aaca8fe907d649aab84be22b8e3b9b37be4507c0be0f949a25a95edecce9", "ja": "ほらあそこ！　さっき飛行機が飛んでたところ！\nでも、もう……あ！", "zh": "看，在那里！刚刚飞机飞过的地方！\n但是已经……啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_05_1031_030iku", "source_sha256": "00b2353f308adec9cbdbee5338eacd4ce786dae0577cde4b1deb1da1fe39847f", "ja": "見えた～～～！！", "zh": "看到了～～～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_05_1032_005yay", "source_sha256": "00b2353f308adec9cbdbee5338eacd4ce786dae0577cde4b1deb1da1fe39847f", "ja": "見えた～～～！！", "zh": "看到了～～～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_05_1033_005yay", "source_sha256": "d027c2d16a525e48bb4b0fc501267930d98d511059a5c59394b359dc877ec409", "ja": "今、ピカーって！　ピカーって流れましたー！", "zh": "刚刚闪过去了！闪亮地划过去了──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_05_1034_040tam", "source_sha256": "8cc2ac8973b44c09c26844941db2162219cee94ad78766e7150dff6c2fdba39e", "ja": "え～っ！？", "zh": "咦～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_05_1035_030iku", "source_sha256": "7f910d5704b1aefacc16c23aacf28441386b8e7eac8d73c5d3762ccca8903dc2", "ja": "キレイ……！　すごーい！\n{$P$}さんも見た！？", "zh": "真美……！好棒喔──！\n{$P$}先生你也看到了吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_05_1036_p", "source_sha256": "2c544f3b21640f4ea110e93cdddc1a12d7813e1ebaee768c391413ea232b149e", "ja": "ああ、綺麗だった。\n育、見られてよかったな。", "zh": "是啊，真漂亮。\n育，幸好能看到呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_05_1037_030iku", "source_sha256": "368ee7c6f1e15d855b45b83f1f1952f81e4d65793dc50af29b087706067b87c5", "ja": "うん！　ありがとう、{$P$}さん！\nわたし、今夜のこと……一生忘れない！", "zh": "嗯！谢谢你，{$P$}先生！\n今天晚上的事……我一辈子都不会忘记！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_05_1038_040tam", "source_sha256": "d7641acc49dc6ba5b07b76b69f9ad038179ba338aa0268012c2c45a637d4048d", "ja": "うぅ、みんな、いいなぁ～。\nたまきだけ見られなかった～……。", "zh": "呜呜，好羡慕大家喔～\n只有环没看到……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_05_1039_p", "source_sha256": "dcc3f8dfcc45123a69de7c924da80e49b9c9ca6188d1b8a0e1c71f1caee624d3", "ja": "環、大丈夫だよ。\nきっとすぐにまた流れるから。", "zh": "环，没事的啦。\n一定很快又会出现的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_05_1040_036kan", "source_sha256": "5217f3e1dc575130ec0643cbb0dab0c26b55d76b4297507f3c1d94278018b495", "ja": "そうだよ、環ちゃん！\n私がもう1度見つけてあげるから！", "zh": "对啊，小环！\n我会为了你再找到一次的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_05_1041_040tam", "source_sha256": "38e8d7b9587ddf4ada4cc0305d75cbbc121dfaac6c035b65206848ff1e1bf7c8", "ja": "かな、ホント！？", "zh": "可奈，真的吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_05_1042_036kan", "source_sha256": "bd176bd9f7fb3f4bdeb206a9ea7403785408c09919816b755b030399bea401a5", "ja": "ほんとほんと！\n私、目はいいから、任せて～！", "zh": "真的真的！\n我眼睛很好，交给我～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_05_1043_036kan", "source_sha256": "e8d45b918b7c1854f374a5abc36db40d3fe97ce3c9f168b42de9aa6161a5e4f4", "ja": "さあっ、流れ星はどこかな～？\n……むむ、あれはっ！", "zh": "好了，流星在哪里呢～？\n……唔唔，那个是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_05_1044_036kan", "source_sha256": "f25116184a4b33ebe51b581de653dbac2c083d828db523d3d7f042d1aa5871ea", "ja": "はれ？　普通の星かな～、違ったみたいっ。\nよーし、今度こそ……むむ、あれは！", "zh": "咦？是普通的星星吧～似乎不是呢。\n好，这次一定……唔唔，那个是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_05_1045_036kan", "source_sha256": "5064ee8ccb098559edb996709c832d3647ee8175f8eb4dc827933b69f1e6dec2", "ja": "はれ！？　また違ったかな～……うぅ。", "zh": "奇怪！？还是不对吗……呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_05_1046_p", "source_sha256": "0e64e7101136074be78ca51a754987060b51774f84242f89f73f3111dbfad45c", "ja": "可奈、大丈夫か？　フラフラしてるが……。", "zh": "可奈，没事吧？你摇摇晃晃的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_05_1047_036kan", "source_sha256": "1714f63c436c1db5d43bd36e1fe929095f543e150164d1273f9e3c800ada02b8", "ja": "はぅぅ～、動きすぎて少し酸欠です～……。", "zh": "啊呜呜～一直动来动去有点缺氧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_05_1048_036kan", "source_sha256": "f276dc85468b522ad989f8b2f72771462d8a66c7fb5c7f90ec70550a3ee6a596", "ja": "目もチカチカしてきて……あ、あれ？\nあーっ！　環ちゃん、今度こそ～！", "zh": "眼睛也开始花了……奇、奇怪？\n啊──！小环～这次一定～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_05_1049_040tam", "source_sha256": "e1d14a63592de9e8f9f662079cd34571e8d665707b27c818b8d9b44461f7ca65", "ja": "ホントだっ！　わ～い、たまきも見れた～！\nありがとね、かな！", "zh": "真的耶！哇～环也看到了～！\n谢啦，可奈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_05_1050_005yay", "source_sha256": "4f623baca926b5252a67a09401e9e2f4e3c57bb23f863bd3c645c84acfcedbdc", "ja": "えへへっ、これでみーんな見られたねっ。\nよかった～。", "zh": "嘿嘿，这样大家都看到了呢，\n太好了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_05_1052_030iku", "source_sha256": "995a73af160de52c9c16695a85e65407fab65270cede338e9a8105fd3f6a22af", "ja": "あのね、{$P$}さん。\n今日は連れてきてくれて、ほんとうにありがとう！", "zh": "那个呀，{$P$}先生。\n今天真的很感谢你带我们出来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_05_1053_p", "source_sha256": "3668defc37ec71b4f2833efedffefa302d6c8fa3f4c07a9db369f4eb6da70068", "ja": "ん？　どうしたんだ、育。\n急にあらたまって。", "zh": "嗯？怎么了啊，育。\n突然说这些。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_05_1054_030iku", "source_sha256": "08e6411d97cbc38cfc6eeb5b7050d773b2513667df02bd1199db3e973b40d978", "ja": "だって、今日はお仕事で来てるんでしょ？\nだからお仕事のお話をするの！", "zh": "因为我们不是来工作的吗？\n我是在跟你讨论工作！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_05_1055_p", "source_sha256": "7db2c97048af84c91643bc1d915dd48435f04d2babb447e3d185624437483ced", "ja": "なるほど、そうだったな。\nレコーディングは、上手くできそうか？", "zh": "原来如此，说得没错呢。\n感觉能顺利完成录音了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_05_1056_030iku", "source_sha256": "1b1dc20875234b00c8607e28a1e330060f1d2848067787af5c7fddda538bc3d3", "ja": "うん！　あの歌の、流れ星をまってる気持ち……。\nわかった気がする。だって、あんなに綺麗なんだもん！", "zh": "嗯！那首歌里等待流星的心情……\n我好像懂了，因为流星那么漂亮嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_05_1057_p", "source_sha256": "67e377b645fa3033fd0c8e5e6df77579c57dd7b44abaf3e6b25fe3d55ffce471", "ja": "おっ、来た甲斐があったみたいだな。\n次のレコーディング、楽しみにしてるぞ！", "zh": "哦，看来跑这一趟很值得呢。\n我很期待下次的录音喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_05_1058_030iku", "source_sha256": "702bc8750ae7a73014925e4d4b2b45ced795d73fa08ac88d9c79d05d9cfb7cb9", "ja": "えへへ、まかせて！\nこの前より、ずっとじょうずに歌ってみせるよ！", "zh": "嘿嘿，包在我们身上！\n我会唱得比之前更好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_05_1059_040tam", "source_sha256": "2511ccd8ebd09f3bf31eaa86748d6c7d998867380ac6870a21b45f3e2079e8eb", "ja": "ねえねえ、おやぶん！\nたまき、今度は夜じゃなくて昼間にここに来たい！", "zh": "欸欸，老大！\n环下次想要白天来这里玩，不要晚上来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_05_1060_005yay", "source_sha256": "64648e1ebfb4075185c4ff0a08d8dfff05974fff137f431de533e5cd1f85ec3b", "ja": "あ、そうだねっ。お昼に来たら、\n山でも川でも、いーっぱい遊べるかも！", "zh": "啊，对耶，要是白天来，\n就可以在山上和河边玩个尽兴了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_05_1061_p", "source_sha256": "2350525d86534e477617629b000d56151208ec427bb9c2711b0d2b8ff4fc870e", "ja": "そうだな。なら、リリースイベントが終わったら、\nまたみんなでここに来ようか。今度はのんびりとな。", "zh": "这样啊，那发片活动结束后，\n我们再一起来这里吧，下次可以悠闲一点，", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_05_1062_005yay", "source_sha256": "86e0ad77d85b1e34871fb22d4f711f0e53727460a43f34bdcb0e80d7312a8075", "ja": "やったー！", "zh": "太好了──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_05_1063_036kan", "source_sha256": "86e0ad77d85b1e34871fb22d4f711f0e53727460a43f34bdcb0e80d7312a8075", "ja": "やったー！", "zh": "太好了──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_05_1064_040tam", "source_sha256": "86e0ad77d85b1e34871fb22d4f711f0e53727460a43f34bdcb0e80d7312a8075", "ja": "やったー！", "zh": "太好了──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_05_1065_030iku", "source_sha256": "86e0ad77d85b1e34871fb22d4f711f0e53727460a43f34bdcb0e80d7312a8075", "ja": "やったー！", "zh": "太好了──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_05_1066_p", "source_sha256": "ebdc7d27b00fb62b5a1c9ce32842cf855ebd075c3f691b433824c80bb65df204", "ja": "（流れ星を待ち望む気持ちは、その美しさを知っている\nからこそ。……最高のハーモニーが聞けそうだな！）", "zh": "（正是因为了解那份美好，才会有期待流星的心情。\n……看来能听到最美妙的和声呢！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
